# canvas_size.uis -- Bild > Leinwandgröße… (Strg+Umschalt+R) (agent A5): every anchor of the
# 3 x 3 grid with pixel probes of both layers, the fill rule of the new area (paint.net: the
# background layer gets the chosen colour -- Sekundärfarbe by default --, every other layer
# transparent pixels), Fülleffekt choices, odd growth (centre = C# integer division),
# shrinking, the selection moves with the image, undo restores the state bit-exactly; the
# dialog (Absolut / Prozentual, anchor combo box <-> grid, fill combo box).
# Window "Leinwandgröße" = 24617 (WINID_DLG0 + 25); widgets 5201 .. 5211 like the resize
# dialog (+100), 5212 Anker, 5213 Fülleffekt, grid cells 5220 .. 5228 (Links oben .. Rechts
# unten).  Hooks: 310 size, 312 anchor | fill << 8 (FILLC_*), 313 / 314 layer probes (#5190),
# 986 / 987 primary / secondary colour (palette A3), 968 new image, 950 / 961 / 962 history.
# The 6 x 4 image: layer 0 (Hintergrund, white) red (0,0), green (5,0), blue (0,3), black
# (5,3); layer 1 yellow (1,0).
size 1280 800
theme light
cmd 950 1
cmd 986 4294902015
cmd 987 4278255615
expect #9986 text "FF00FFFF"
cmd 968 262150
cmd 902 1
cmd 903 0
cmd 904 65537
cmd 902 2
cmd 903 5
cmd 904 65542
cmd 902 3
cmd 903 196608
cmd 904 262145
cmd 902 6
cmd 903 196613
cmd 904 262150
key ctrl+shift+n
cmd 902 9
cmd 903 1
cmd 904 65538
cmd 961 0
expect text:"t.n=2" exists

